WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.760 --> 00:00:04.300
The TURBOCURSA page: play right now in the browser, nothing to install.

2
00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:10.700
The browser version is one HTML file that also works offline. Install it from your browser's menu.

3
00:00:11.270 --> 00:00:15.700
The native Rust app for Windows, macOS and Linux: one command, or a direct download.

4
00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:23.900
Direct links to the latest release: browser, Windows, macOS (Apple Silicon and Intel), Linux, source and SHA-256 checksums.

5
00:00:24.550 --> 00:00:34.200
On Linux and macOS one command downloads, verifies the checksum and installs.

6
00:00:34.300 --> 00:00:45.230
Then start it with turbocursa. On Windows, use the PowerShell line from the page.

7
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.220
Every option sits in the bar above the game.

8
00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:57.770
Mode: campaign, time trial, endless, rush hour, orbs, rings, reversal, blackout, zen…

9
00:00:58.270 --> 00:01:00.150
Car paint: the livery of any country.

10
00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:07.130
Vehicle: from sports cars to trucks and Formula cars.

11
00:01:07.630 --> 00:01:13.310
Difficulty, from Easy to Insane.

12
00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:18.250
Weather: rain, snow, fog and more.

13
00:01:18.750 --> 00:01:23.140
Surface: asphalt, frozen lake, dunes…

14
00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:29.210
Time of day: dawn, day, dusk, night.

15
00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.560
Vision: filters for colour blindness and a high-contrast view.

16
00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.980
Assist: holds bends, self-centring, gentle walls.

17
00:01:35.480 --> 00:01:48.210
Press Enter and drive: arrows steer, Space is turbo.

18
00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:56.030
The interface comes in 8 languages.

19
00:02:06.090 --> 00:02:09.790
Drive with the arrow keys; Space is turbo.

20
00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:13.870
Esc pauses the stage: everything freezes.

21
00:02:14.270 --> 00:02:17.440
Esc resumes it.

22
00:02:17.840 --> 00:02:21.010
Switching window or tab pauses automatically.

23
00:02:21.410 --> 00:02:24.020
On a phone, a tap resumes.

24
00:02:24.420 --> 00:02:28.820
In pause, Enter restarts the stage.

25
00:02:30.130 --> 00:02:43.630
The native app, here in demo mode: the pilot drives every level by itself (turbocursa --demo).

26
00:02:44.130 --> 00:02:59.330
Esc quits the demo; in a normal race Esc pauses.
